      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... i don't want a new chapter. i'm just so tired of the constant loop of chasing something just to feel empty again. it feels like i've finished the game and the credits are rolling, but everyone expects me to just start a new save file and do it all over again. it feels so futile. like, if the peak is just more emptiness, why keep going?",
